'hos_ETHERNET_ADDRESS_DESCRIPTION' => '(en)The ethernet address is optional and causes the DHCP server to statically bind the local IP address to the computer with this ethernet address. If specified, it must be of the form "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF" and must contain only the numbers 0-9 and the letters A-F.',
